d:
This is a visual novel game, sequel to "Mega Casanova" on Sega Mega Drive (NTSC/PAL)/Genesis.

In this game, Casanova, while relaxing on the beach with beautiful girls, passes out under the hot sun. But he was lucky that those girls from the beach turned out to be doctors working at a local rehab center. The hero's uncle pays for his treatment. Casanova regains consciousness at the medical center. Remembering everything, he must check his health, pass tests and, of course, seduce one of the four beauties in white coats.

In the arcade part, you have 20 seconds to massage the girl. Finding the right rhythm is easy.

Peculiarities:

15+ backgrounds;

10+ melodies;

4 girls for seduction and 3 finals;

2 mini-game: massage and quiz;

3 languages to choose from: English, German and Russian.

This is a hack of Sonic 3 & Knuckles that is a cross-over between Castlevania, Ghosts 'n Goblins and Sonic game series, focused on boss fights (but not forgetting fast-paced platforming either!) and providing a unique story and aesthetic not seen in other hacks of the Sonic games.

Overall features:

* 10 acts of fast-paced platforming and hard-as-nails fights across 4 zones;
* 15 mini-bosses to fight, 3 major bosses to really sink your teeth into, and one final boss that really is something special;
* A soundtrack of remixes and original songs that pushes the console to its absolute limits, available in the Sound Test as well;
* Four difficulty modes, including Normal, Hard, Assist (if you're struggling, and we don't judge by the way!), and Maniac (if you are truly insane);
* And finally, a mode that disables flashing effects, if you need that.
